// Package parity holds the ids of the feature registry (shared/parity/features.yaml, ADR-0037 and
// ADR-0045 §3) as Go constants, generated by `task gen` (features_gen.go): Go code that refers to a
// feature uses a constant, so a feature the registry lacks does not compile. The registry itself
// is checked by `task parity`.
package parity

// FeatureID is the id of a feature of the registry, such as "vault.create".
type FeatureID string
